2026-06-17 @ 10:00 - [Feat – Replace nginx + PHP-FPM with Apache + mod_php]:
  Replaced the two-container nginx + php-fpm setup with a single apache-php
  container (Apache 2.4 + mod_php 8.1).  The BPA WebServer Plugin for Apache
  has a stable module API across Apache 2.4.x releases, eliminating the
  ABI version-mismatch problem that affected the nginx plugin.

  Both the PHP probe and the BPA Apache plugin are injected opportunistically
  at container startup from the APMIA shared volume — the container starts
  cleanly without either if the agent volume is absent.

  src/apache-php/Dockerfile (new):
  - Multi-stage build (ubuntu:22.04); Stage 1 extracts app.tar.gz, Stage 2
    installs apache2 + libapache2-mod-php8.1 + php8.1-{cli,mysql,mbstring}.
  - Listens on port 8080 (sed -i on /etc/apache2/ports.conf).
  - Enables mods: rewrite, headers, php8.1; disables default site; enables
    bpa-demo.conf via a2ensite.

  src/apache-php/entrypoint.sh (new):
  - PHP probe: copies .so to extension_dir, installs INI to
    /etc/php/8.1/apache2/conf.d/, patches collector host/port/appname/logdir.
  - BPA plugin: finds mod_*.so in extensions/WebServerPlugin/; derives module
    name from filename (mod_<name>.so → <name>_module); writes LoadModule to
    conf-enabled/bpa.conf; validates with apache2ctl configtest; disables if
    rejected (safe fallback).
  - Starts Apache as PID 1 via `exec apache2 -D FOREGROUND`.

  src/apache-php/config/vhost.conf (new):
  - VirtualHost *:8080; logs to /proc/self/fd/1 and /proc/self/fd/2.
  - AllowOverride All; /setup/ denied; hidden files denied.

  src/dx-o2-agents/Dockerfile:
  - Extended BPA extraction step to also search non-nginx tarballs in the
    BPA zip for Apache mod_*.so files and install them flat to
    extensions/WebServerPlugin/. Non-fatal when absent (nginx-only BPA zip).

  docker-compose.yml:
  - Removed phpfpm and nginx services.
  - Added apachephp service (apache-php image, port 8080, apmia_data:ro).
  - APMIA_PHP_COLLECTOR_HOST=dxo2 and APMIA_BTL_HOST=dxo2 in the same service
    (Compose services reach each other by name, not 127.0.0.1).

  helm/php-demo/templates/deployment.yaml:
  - Removed nginx and php-fpm containers.
  - Added apache-php container with http/8080, MariaDB env, APMIA env,
    app-config vhost.conf subPath mount, apmia-share mount.
  - Renamed volume nginx-config → app-config; removed tmp-nginx emptyDir.
  - Updated dxo2-init comment to reference apache-php.

  helm/php-demo/templates/configmap.yaml:
  - Replaced nginx.conf + default.conf + www.conf with a single vhost.conf key.

  helm/php-demo/values.yaml:
  - Replaced image.phpfpm + image.nginx with image.apachephp.
  - Merged nginx + phpfpm resource budgets into resources.apachephp (128/384 Mi).
  - Merged probes into probes.apachephp (httpGet port 8080 for both live/ready).

  build-scripts/build.sh:
  - Replaced PHP_FPM_IMAGE + NGINX_IMAGE build steps with APACHE_PHP_IMAGE.
  - cleanup() now removes src/apache-php/app.tar.gz.

  build-scripts/package-app.sh:
  - Archive destination changed from src/php-fpm/app.tar.gz to
    src/apache-php/app.tar.gz.

  build-scripts/deploy.sh:
  - Image section in generate_values() updated to apachephp (removed phpfpm/nginx).
  - post_deploy_init() container flag changed from -c php-fpm to -c apache-php.

  build-scripts/push.sh:
  - Replaced PHP_FPM_IMAGE + NGINX_IMAGE with APACHE_PHP_IMAGE.

  .gitignore:
  - Updated ignored archive path from src/php-fpm/ to src/apache-php/.

  CLAUDE.md:
  - Technology stack: replaced PHP-FPM + nginx rows with Apache + mod_php.
  - All references to nginx/php-fpm updated to apache-php.
  - Key file paths and Docker Compose notes updated.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2026-06-16 @ 15:30 - [Fix BPA nginx plugin version mismatch]:
  The Dockerfile was hardcoded to select the nginx 1.17.1 plugin from the
  BPA zip. nginx 1.18.0 (ubuntu:22.04) requires a module built against
  exactly the same nginx version — 1.17.x and 1.18.x are NOT ABI-compatible.
  Symptom: "module version 1017001 instead of 1018000", nginx crash on start.

  src/dx-o2-agents/Dockerfile:
  - Replaced hardcoded ngx_1.17.1 selection with a loop that extracts ALL
    nginx plugin variants from the BPA zip and stores each as
    ngx_http_ca_plugin_filter_module_<ver>.so (e.g. _1.18.0.so).
    The image now carries every available nginx version; no rebuild needed
    when the target nginx version changes.

  src/nginx/entrypoint.sh:
  - Removed fixed BPA_MODULE path (bare .so no longer exists).
  - Added nginx version detection via `nginx -v`.
  - Selects the exact-version-matched .so first; falls back to any available
    variant if no exact match found.
  - Runs `nginx -t` immediately after writing bpa.conf.  If the test fails
    (version mismatch), removes bpa.conf and logs a clear diagnostic with the
    list of available .so variants before starting nginx without BPA — the
    container no longer crashes on a module version mismatch.

  CLAUDE.md:
  - Technology stack: NGINX note updated to clarify that the BPA plugin
    requires an exact nginx version match, not just a series ceiling.

