2026-06-16 @ 14:00 - [DX O2 interface installer format – complete overhaul]:
  Replaced the single-archive support.broadcom.com installer model with the
  three-package DX O2 interface download format.  The DX O2 download includes
  a pre-configured IntroscopeAgent.profile (tenant EM URL + JWT) that must not
  be overwritten.  Corrected PHP collector port (5005) and BTL port (8000) to
  match the actual DX O2 installer defaults.  Fixed property names used when
  patching wily_php_agent.ini (wily_php_agent.* format, not Java properties).

  src/dx-o2-agents/Dockerfile (complete rewrite):
  - Added SHELL ["/bin/bash", "-c"] (required for [[ ]] bash syntax; ubuntu:22.04
    uses dash as /bin/sh).
  - Removed openjdk-11-jre-headless (bundled JRE included in PHP_apmia*.tar).
  - Detects PHP_apmia*.tar (not apmia-*.tar.gz); extracts to /opt – creates /opt/apmia/.
  - Normalises PHP probe to extensions/PHPAgent/ (copied from probe/lib/php81/).
  - Extracts Business_Transaction_Listener.zip → /opt/btlistener/.
  - Extracts nginx 1.17.1 plugin from Business_Payload_Analyzer_WebServer_Plugins.zip
    → extensions/WebServerPlugin/.
  - Makes APMIAgent.sh, APMIACtrl.sh, BTListener.sh executable.
  - Removed install.sh -i silent step (not applicable to DX O2 format).

  src/dx-o2-agents/entrypoint.sh (complete rewrite):
  - Sets JAVA_HOME to bundled JRE at ${APMIA_HOME}/jre/.
  - Locates profile at core/config/IntroscopeAgent.profile (new path).
  - Never renders profile from template; patches only agentName and
    application.name; all agentManager.* lines (EM URL, JWT) are left intact.
  - Starts APMIAgent.sh in console (foreground) mode via Java Service Wrapper.
  - Starts BTListener.sh if present.
  - Corrected APMIA_PHP_COLLECTOR_PORT default: 55512 → 5005.
  - Corrected APMIA_BTL_PORT default: 9001 → 8000.

  src/php-fpm/entrypoint.sh:
  - Corrected PHP collector port default: 55512 → 5005.
  - Fixed patching property names: wily_php_agent.collectorHost/Port
    (not introscope.agent.php.collectorAddress – wrong format for PHP INI).
  - Added APMIA_APP_NAME patching (wily_php_agent.application.name).
  - Added wily_php_agent.logdir redirect to /tmp.
  - Fixed: changed 'local ini_path=' (invalid outside function) to INI_PATH=.

  src/nginx/entrypoint.sh:
  - Corrected BTL port default: 9001 → 8000.
  - Removed webserver_plugin.ini patching (file not present in DX O2 BPA
    package; only the .so is shipped).

  src/dx-o2-agents/config/IntroscopeAgent.profile.template:
  - Removed introscope.agent.php.collectorAddress property (was incorrect
    for both installer formats; PHP probe uses wily_php_agent.ini, not
    IntroscopeAgent.profile, for IPC configuration).

  build-scripts/build.sh:
  - Installer detection pattern changed from apmia-*.tar.gz to PHP_apmia*.tar.

  helm/php-demo/values.yaml:
  - dxo2.phpCollectorPort: 55512 → 5005 (matches wily_php_agent.ini default).
  - dxo2.btlPort: 9001 → 8000 (matches BTL application.properties default).
  - dxo2.emHost: now optional (documented as not needed for DX O2 download).

  helm/php-demo/templates/deployment.yaml:
  - APMIA_EM_HOST env var: changed from required to conditional
    ({{- if .Values.dxo2.emHost }}) for DX O2 pre-configured profile support.
  - Named ports on dx-o2-agent container updated: php-collector 5005, btl 8000.

  build-scripts/deploy.sh:
  - apmia_php_collector_port default: 55512 → 5005.
  - apmia_btl_port default: 9001 → 8000.

  .config.example:
  - APMIA_PHP_COLLECTOR_PORT: 55512 → 5005.
  - APMIA_BTL_PORT: 9001 → 8000.
  - Updated comments to reflect DX O2 interface download and pre-configured
    profile; APMIA_EM_HOST documented as optional for DX O2 format.

  DX-O2-AGENT-SETUP.md (complete rewrite):
  - Section 1: Updated compatibility matrix (bundled JRE replaces openjdk).
  - Section 2: Download source changed from support.broadcom.com to DX O2
    interface; three packages listed with navigation paths.
  - Section 3: Placement instructions updated for three archives.
  - Section 4: Complete directory layout documented for new installer format.
