2026-06-16 @ 11:30 - [WSS default + same-pod IPC addressing for DX O2 probes]:
  Changed EM connection protocol to WSS (WebSocket Secure) as default.
  Added explicit same-pod IPC addressing so the PHP probe and BPA WebServer
  Plugin can reach the Infrastructure Agent and BTL without hardcoded addresses.

  src/dx-o2-agents/config/IntroscopeAgent.profile.template:
  - Replaced DefaultSocketFactory with WSSSocketFactory (WSS default, port 8443).
  - Added introscope.agent.php.collectorAddress property rendered from
    APMIA_PHP_COLLECTOR_HOST / APMIA_PHP_COLLECTOR_PORT env vars.

  src/dx-o2-agents/entrypoint.sh:
