2026-06-11 @ 14:00  BPA-Demo web shop application (Phase 5)

  Full smart-home device web shop built on top of the existing Kubernetes
  pod platform.  Three brands (Shelly, SonOff, Tuya), 150 products, full
  basket and checkout flow, admin panel, and monitoring HTTP headers.

  New files – PHP application (app/src/):
  - index.php              Front-controller; routes via ?page=<slug>
  - config/app.php         Session bootstrap, CSRF token helpers
  - config/database.php    PDO singleton, reads credentials from environment
  - lib/validate.php       Type/size validators (string, int, email, price,
                           CC number / Luhn, expiry, CVV, username, password)
  - lib/page_id.php        set_monitoring_headers() emits X-Page-ID,
                           X-User-Role, X-Basket-Total, X-Alert, X-Use-Case
  - lib/auth.php           Login with $SETUP$<plain> → bcrypt upgrade on first
                           login; session-fixation prevention; role helpers
  - lib/product.php        product_list() with filters (brand, capability,
                           search, price range, pagination); product_get_by_slug/id
  - lib/basket.php         Session-based basket; basket_total() forces 0.00
                           for empty_basket use-case users
  - lib/order.php          order_create() with DB transaction; order_get();
                           order_list_for_user()
  - lib/usecase.php        File-based use-case loader; admin assign/unassign;
                           usecase_available() scans usecases/ directory
  - pages/shop.php         Product grid with filter bar and pagination
  - pages/product.php      Single product detail page
  - pages/basket.php       Basket view/edit (POST–Redirect–GET pattern)
  - pages/checkout.php     Billing + fake CC payment form with full validation
  - pages/order.php        Order confirmation + order history list
  - pages/login.php        Login form with CSRF protection
  - pages/logout.php       Session destroy + redirect
  - pages/admin.php        Admin dashboard: stats, user list, use-case assignment
  - templates/layout.php   Full HTML page shell with embedded CSS:
                           dark sidebar, sticky topbar, product grid,
                           basket table, checkout card layout, admin table,
                           badge/pill components, responsive breakpoints
  - templates/footer.php   Closing </main>, page-wrapper, and <footer>
  - usecases/trouble.php   5000 sequential DB reads (simulates slow session)
  - usecases/empty_basket.php  No-op; basket_total() handles forced-zero logic
  - setup/init_users.php   CLI-only DB connectivity and seed check script

  New files – Database SQL (helm/php-demo/sql/):
  - schema.sql             8 tables: brands, capabilities, products,
                           product_capabilities, users, user_usecases,
                           orders, order_items
  - seed.sql               3 brands, 6 capabilities, 150 products (50 × brand),
                           product_capabilities mappings, 13 demo users
                           (admin, trouble, empty, alice … jack) with
                           $SETUP$demo123 passwords, pre-assigned use cases

  New files – Helm chart:
